     <section class="screen panel" data-screen="howto" hidden>
       <header class="sheet-head"><button class="back" data-focus data-go="back" aria-label="Back">${Ou(`back`)}</button><h2>How to play</h2></header>
       <div class="sheet-body"><div class="how"><table class="controls">${Mu.map(([e,t])=>`<tr><td>${e}</td><td>${dn(t)}</td></tr>`).join(``)}</table>
       <div class="modes"><p><b>Race:</b> the city's night run against two local rivals. Knock them into the barrier, smash crates, don't rear-end a bus. First across the line wins.</p>
       <p><b>Story:</b> every city has its own arc: chapters with their own roads and goals. Clear them to earn praise names, sung at the start line and printed on your WANTED poster (Legend).</p>
       <p><b>The System:</b> every race gives XP. Level up from Rank E to S and spend stat points (Status). A new daily quest waits each day; keep your streak.</p>
       <p><b>Gates:</b> challenge stages ranked E to S. Each rank's Gate is its rank-up quest: your level waits at the rank's edge until you clear it. Gates also open on the road in Quick Race (a red one is harder and pays double): ride through to enter.</p>
       <p><b>Shadows:</b> rivals you K.O. and bosses you bring down rise as Shadows. Choose one in Status: it rides beside you in Kokoro Rush and strikes.</p>
       <p><b>Kokoro Rush:</b> riding with style fills RUSH. Unleash it: a speed surge, untouchable, and a shockwave that throws rivals aside.</p>
       <p><b>Ramps and shields:</b> hit a ramp (planks on drums) fast and fly over traffic; a long one is BIG AIR. Grab the street snack and the next crash or hit just bounces off.</p>
       <p><b>Postcards:</b> ride past each city's landmarks to collect their postcards (Legend).</p>
       <p><b>Ambush:</b> three waves of road touts want your "dues". K.O. them all before three laps run out. Rivals you beat in the Story join your crew and fight beside you.</p>
       <p><b>Flow:</b> ride a whole line of cowries and Sade pulls a stunt: WHEELIE, then STAND-UP, then KOKORO SPIN if you chain lines. Stunts score, refill boost and drop ⚙ parts.</p>
       <p><b>Home Base:</b> build with ◎ and ⚙. A coin magnet, a drink stand that pre-charges Rush, a grill, a mechanic, and a billboard that earns while you're away.</p>
       <p><b>Grab:</b> cowries (money for the Garage), the local drink (refills boost) and street food (heals), each named the way the city names it. Near misses, hits, overtakes and clean laps build your combo up to ×5. A crash breaks it.</p>
       <p><b>Missions:</b> three at a time on the home screen. Finish them for ◎; spend ◎ on paint in the Garage.</p>
       <p><b>Time Trial:</b> just you and the ghost of your best run. The split under the clock says if you're ahead.</p>
       <p><b>Rainy season:</b> some nights it pours (Settings → Weather). The road gets slick: brake earlier, turn wider.</p></div></div></div>
     </section>

